---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { url } from "../lib/url";
---
<Base title="Download" description="Clessidra's firmware for the Synthux Simple Touch, and how to flash it.">
<h1>Download</h1>
<p class="lead">Firmware for the Synthux Simple Touch, flashed over USB.</p>

<h2 class="label">Steps</h2>
<ol class="panel rows steps">
  <li class="row"><span class="label">1.</span><span>Download the <a href="https://github.com/francesco-di-maggio/clessidra/releases/latest/download/Clessidra.bin">Firmware</a></span></li>
  <li class="row"><span class="label">2.</span><span>Connect the Seed over USB</span></li>
  <li class="row"><span class="label">3.</span><span>Hold BOOT, tap RESET, then release BOOT</span></li>
  <li class="row"><span class="label">4.</span><span>Open the <a href="https://electro-smith.github.io/Programmer/">Daisy Web Programmer</a> (from Chrome or Edge):
    <ul class="tall"><li>Connect</li><li>Choose the file</li><li>Program</li></ul><ul class="low"><li>Connect, choose the file, and program</li></ul></span></li>
</ol>

<h2 class="label">Resources</h2>
<ul class="panel lists list across">
  <li><a href={url("clessidra-manual.pdf")} download><span class="text"><b>Manual</b><span class="sub">A4, 2 pages</span></span><svg class="file" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-label="PDF"><path d="M6 2.5h8l4.5 4.5v14.5h-12.5z M14 2.5v4.5h4.5" /><text x="12" y="17.5">PDF</text></svg></a></li>
  <li><a href="https://github.com/francesco-di-maggio/clessidra/releases"><span class="text"><b>Releases</b><span class="sub">Changes per version</span></span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
  <li><a href="https://github.com/francesco-di-maggio/clessidra"><span class="text"><b>Source</b><span class="sub">Builds with the Daisy Toolchain</span></span><span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
</ul>
</Base>
